From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 04:34:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 14/16] Coverflow -> Lyrics: the middle card flies into the
 lyrics cover

The flight from coverFlight.ts is now general (FlightPlan): Lyrics -> Blueprint and Coverflow -> Lyrics use
it. The lyrics cover's spot is read off the hidden split preset (its width, cover size, stack top, reach,
centred), so nothing is built while the cover moves; the lyrics view is revealed when the copy is all but
landed and fades in around it. The start layer shows the card's own picture, the end layer the cover's.
The coverflow key's exit takes the same flight.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
